[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16153.389, "timestamp": "04:29:13", "text": "畏缩。哦，我新买了一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16155.99, "timestamp": "04:29:15", "text": "东西。第20季。我的天哪，那是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16162.51, "timestamp": "04:29:22", "text": "疯狂的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16165.75, "timestamp": "04:29:25", "text": "好的。嗯，是的，我们赢了一场比赛。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16169.269, "timestamp": "04:29:29", "text": "在大逃杀模式中遥遥领先。那挺好的。顶部"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16170.11, "timestamp": "04:29:30", "text": "二"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16172.99, "timestamp": "04:29:32", "text": "一次。是的，我们会做一个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16174.51, "timestamp": "04:29:34", "text": "最后的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16176.67, "timestamp": "04:29:36", "text": "东西，然后我们把它包起来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16181.469, "timestamp": "04:29:41", "text": "起来，我要卸载这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16184.83, "timestamp": "04:29:44", "text": "游戏。但下次我见到你时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16189.349, "timestamp": "04:29:49", "text": "下次我们再好好玩吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16190.59, "timestamp": "04:29:50", "text": "这是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16198.51, "timestamp": "04:29:58", "text": "嗯，我想变得像这样"}]